{
  "$schema": "../../schema/recipe.schema.json",
  "name": "plinth",
  "description": "A single object on a seamless ground, the product-shot cover: the mark extruded into a solid block in the accent with a soft floor shadow, or (`object: \"cutout\"`) the cut-out subject; the artist and title centred above. Slots: {name} (artist), {title} (release), {mark} or {cutout}, the palette (bg, text, accent), `object`. Fonts: Inter Tight (register them as TTF/WOFF; WOFF2 can't be outlined).",
